WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:08.290
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:14.790
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.630
It's my day!

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:27.210
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:34.610
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:41.990
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:49.390
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:55.170
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:02.310
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:09.810
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:15.950
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:19.020
I just want to walk

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.560
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.530
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:35.440
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:41.880
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.150
It's my day!

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:13.910
<i>Who are these guys?</i>

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:21.420
<i>They're wearing our uniform,
but I don't remember any of them.</i>

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:24.320
This is the storage
in the old gymnasium.

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:27.430
Yell all you want,
but no one will come.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:30.630
She's scared...

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:33.000
Don't worry, we won't kill you.

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.070
Just hold still for a second.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:53.520
Take this to them.

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:59.420
<i>Scary... These guys are insane.</i>

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:04.260
You're late.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:31.520
<i>No!</i>

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:44.840
"Domyoji... Won't Come?"

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:57.520
What's going on with Tsukasa?

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:02.820
What the...?

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:05.060
So here you are...

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:10.160
Tsukasa! Where were you?

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:12.330
I took the cruiser out for a spin.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:13.460
Out for a spin?!

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:17.340
Want some?

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:19.400
Wha...?

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:21.370
Well, if you don't want it...

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:25.380
Listen, what are you planning to do
about Makino?

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:27.810
Makino?

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:39.720
<i>J-Junpei...</i>

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.030
I'm sorry, Makino.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:43.800
<i>Why?</i>

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.300
I've been using you.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.630
I'm the one who gave you
the red card.

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:55.570
The one who dropped 
the pot from the third floor...

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.180
was these guys.

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:03.450
Who'd've thought things would go
so smoothly?

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.220
<i>So it wasn't Domyoji after all...</i>

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:09.450
<i>Why couldn't I see that?
I'm such a fool!</i>

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.730
Jun, you'd make a better actor
than a model.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.460
I guess tricking a lamb like this one
is right up your alley.

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.800
You guys have to stop 
straying from the plan.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:25.470
I was going to bring her
and meet you here, right?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:30.480
Sorry. Sorry... You seemed
pretty stuck on her.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:34.850
We thought you might develop a
conscience and double-cross us.

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:42.650
Double-cross you?
Don't be ridiculous!

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:45.920
Whose plan got us this far, anyway?

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.430
Hey! Cut it out!
We gotta stick together.

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:53.000
<i>Makino, don't you want a friend?</i>

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:56.270
<i>Makino, I'll protect you.</i>

00:05:57.240 --> 00:06:02.870
<i>Makino, don't you want a friend?
I'll protect you.</i>

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:11.480
<i>This is Junpei Oribe?</i>

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:16.290
<i>Why? Why is he doing this?</i>

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.740
Will you leave us alone
for a second?

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:23.490
I need to talk to her.

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:56.890
I can't untie you, but...

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:01.600
Damn you!

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:04.700
You don't deserve to live!
You creep!

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:09.910
You're scum! What are you doing,
hanging out with guys like them!

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:11.010
Idiot!

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:22.190
I... I have a brother.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.890
He has a strong sense of justice.

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:29.860
He always told me
that if I believed I was right...

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:32.860
I shouldn't knuckle under
to any kind of pressure.

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:41.870
When he was in middle school,
he attended Eitoku.

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:44.240
Along with the F4.

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:47.710
You probably heard the story...

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:52.720
There was a guy who was nearly killed
when he went against the F4.

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:54.620
You don't mean...

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:58.720
Domyoji kicked him in the stomach.
Ruptured his intestines.

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:01.540
We tried to take him to court...

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.660
but his father used his money
to cover it up.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.940
My brother changed after that.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:17.810
He's afraid. He doesn't believe
in himself... or anything else.

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:35.190
I couldn't stand to 
see my brother like that.

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:39.730
To see the brother I love like that!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.870
It's all Domyoji's fault.

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:53.040
Those four other guys have a grudge
against him, too.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:55.280
I met them at a club.

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:57.880
Then... I...

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:02.720
I'm sorry, but I'm using you
to lure Domyoji out here.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:05.520
He should be here soon.

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:07.860
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:10.500
Makino got a red card?

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:12.960
I figured it wasn't you.

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:14.170
Then, who?

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.640
Damn! They won't get away with this.

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:20.810
Master Tsukasa!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:26.780
A boy with blond hair
came to the door with this!

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:33.350
This is Makino's...

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:37.660
STORAGE AREA

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:40.710
"The storage area
in the old gymnasium."

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.030
"Come alone."

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.000
Makino...

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:50.870
To think that it was all a lie...

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.540
I thought you were like
what I used to be.

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:58.260
I thought you were struggling
to survive...

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:02.680
...in this piddling high-society clique
called Eitoku...

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:04.180
That's why I became your friend.

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:07.550
But you...

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.760
I know what Domyoji did
was unforgivable.

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:12.920
But what about you?!

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:16.110
You used such a dirty trick...

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:20.330
You talk about justice,
but you're acting like a villain.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.040
You don't understand how I feel!

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:28.170
No, I don't!

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:32.440
If it's revenge you want,
go face to face with him!

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:34.450
You're just a coward!

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:35.950
Shut up! You!

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:58.440
<i>Leave me alone. I want to get away
from you and the F4.</i>

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.870
<i>It's probably Domyoji.</i>

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:07.980
Domyoji won't come.

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:17.660
<i>This is what I get...
not only for hurting Domyoji,</i>

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:23.630
<i>but for not even being 
able to trust him.</i>

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:33.670
<i>Domyoji... I'm so sorry.</i>

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:21.010
Uh-oh...

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:23.150
Why'd you take the tape off, Jun?

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:25.770
We'll be in trouble if she yells.

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:29.490
Don't worry. Nobody comes
to this old building.

00:12:29.490 --> 00:12:30.230
Huh?

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:33.870
- Your lip is split.
- Don't touch it!

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:37.370
I see... So that's how it is...

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:41.740
This girl bit your lip, is that it?

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.610
Keep your dirty hands off me.

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:47.810
Scary... But I'm not afraid of you.

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:52.250
Eitoku's queen bitch
don't scare me at all!

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:57.460
You called us dirty,
but we're no match for your boyfriend.

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:01.780
That was really something...
at that Azabu nightclub...

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:04.350
He punched your lights out.

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:07.820
Yeah... I'm gonna pay him back
for that today.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:08.970
What a loser!

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:19.410
I wondered what sort of grudge
you had against him.

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:21.410
He punched your lights out?

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:25.250
What a laugh! It just shows
how weak you are!

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:29.420
You've got to do something this cowardly
just to show him up?

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:34.430
What a laugh!
You pea-brained clowns!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:40.970
Damn you!

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:48.940
How's that?!

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.950
We can do anything we like with you.
Get the message?

00:13:58.120 --> 00:13:59.720
He won't come.

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:04.890
I'm telling you, I'm not his girlfriend.

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:07.870
If you don't believe me,

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:10.660
you'll be waiting here
a long, long time, you fools.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:13.500
Damn you, you stupid bitch!

00:14:15.300 --> 00:14:16.830
I'll kill you first!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:17.500
Stop it!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.380
- Let go! I said let go of her!
- What's the use in hurting the lure?

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:23.720
- Don't stop him, Jun!
- Let me go! Let me go, I said!

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:25.640
- I said, let me go!
- You can't do this!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.680
H-hey, he's here!

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:05.450
Got your invitation.

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:09.750
You're late.
What took you so long?

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:14.390
Let's get this over with.
What do you want me to do?

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:17.400
Nothing difficult at all.

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:21.900
Just stand still.
We'll do all the work.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:25.900
Why are you here?
Why are you here, you idiot?!

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:29.870
You stupid fool!

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:38.950
Don't make any stupid moves,
or she'll get it with these scissors.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:43.290
Makino...

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:49.460
Don't look at me like that.

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:51.000
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:52.830
Keep your eyes closed.

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:54.070
Get him!

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:09.980
It's me... You punched me
in the jaw. Remember?

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.790
I don't remember anyone
as sorry looking as you.

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:17.120
Damn you! I'll kill you!

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:21.430
Stop it! Stop it!

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:23.190
Stop it!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.970
You look like you want to hit back.

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:34.140
What's with that look?!

00:16:42.510 --> 00:16:46.820
Do it. Go ahead...
Go ahead and hit me.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:52.520
Do it, and your Makino
will get hers.

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:24.560
Your punches don't work.
Isn't there anybody stronger here?

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:26.590
Take him!

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:29.560
Let me at him.

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:34.400
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:43.640
<i>He's never been hit
by anyone before...</i>

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:49.410
<i>He's strong enough to beat up
a whole gang of punks like them!</i>

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:52.680
<i>But why?</i>

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:06.260
He's taking too long...

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:11.440
Hey, let's go.
I can't sit here waiting.

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:12.940
No, let's wait.

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:15.870
He did say he was going in alone...

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:20.280
Damn! We'll teach them that
F4 is the four of us.

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:25.550
We'll be able to do that later.
I can hardly wait.

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:48.070
Is that all?

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:55.580
I-is he crazy?

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:04.090
You're not very strong...

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:17.200
Move!

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:24.110
No! Domyoji!

00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:56.840
Please stop...

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.010
You've done enough, haven't you?

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:14.590
Let's beat her up, too!

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:15.360
No!

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:16.360
Jun?

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:20.430
That's enough... Let's go.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:25.600
Humph! This oughta teach you
not to strut your stuff around!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:27.610
Serves you right!

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:44.220
Domyoji, are you all right? Domyoji...

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:58.400
O-of course not. Ugh...
My ribs are broken.

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:02.270
You idiot!
Why didn't you fight them back?

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:05.710
You could have easily clobbered
five of them!

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:07.710
Are you stupid?

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:11.580
If I fought back,
I would have lost.

00:21:12.720 --> 00:21:15.690
I couldn't protect you like that.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.390
Domyoji?

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:27.330
No... Domyoji?

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:35.910
You can't die! Domyoji!

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:43.610
Domyoji!

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:10.980
You let your hair down a little

00:22:12.980 --> 00:22:18.850
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:28.730
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:36.770
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:36.770 --> 00:22:44.580
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:44.810 --> 00:22:52.720
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:44.810 --> 00:22:52.720
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:52.720 --> 00:23:01.060
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:52.720 --> 00:23:01.060
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:02.860 --> 00:23:10.840
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:10.840 --> 00:23:18.610
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:26.780
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:26.780
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:35.230
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:35.230
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:47.270 --> 00:23:49.240
After being beaten up
by four boys with a grudge,

00:23:49.310 --> 00:23:50.880
Domyoji is taken to a hospital.

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:54.380
But Junpei Oribe comes to see him.

00:23:54.880 --> 00:23:58.720
Please, don't touch him.
What else are you planning?

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:00.350
Haven't you done enough?

00:24:01.450 --> 00:24:04.090
Hana Yori Dango: 
"Someday We'll Laugh..."

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:08.130
Whatever the reason,
I can't forgive him for now.
